OL,5,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FJohn hopes that the scaffolding
OL,7,     Foutside the Alexandra Hotel in
OL,8,     FLlandudno won't put off his
OL,9,     Fguests. But there are slip-ups
OL,10,     Fwith towels and teabags, and
OL,11,     FGloria gets locked in the loo.
OL,12,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,14,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,15,     Ffor one last time to settle some
OL,16,     Fscores and find out how much
OL,17,     Fthey've been paid - and who's won.
