OL,5,G1135 Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FPeterborough. Land surveyor Moony
OL,7,     Fhosts a Pakistani evening, with
OL,8,     Ffamily recipes and an authentic
OL,9,     Fseating arrangement on the floor
OL,10,     Fof his specially dressed dining
OL,11,     Froom. (Ep1/5)
OL,12,G1205 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FPeterborough. Driving instructor
OL,14,     FChristine's guests are dreading
OL,15,     Fher meat-free menu, while
OL,16,     FChristine is anxious about Rosie's
OL,17,     Ffeedback after she compared
OL,18,     FMoony's food to vomit. (Ep2/5)
