OL,5,G1235 Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FPeterborough. Mobile hairdresser
OL,7,     FBen plans a gourmet night, as he
OL,8,     Fentertains his guests with his
OL,9,     Famazing body art, cooking skills
OL,10,     Fand pet crabs. (Ep3/5)
OL,11,G1305 Come Dine with Me
OL,12,     FPeterborough. Can fridge salesman
OL,13,     FGregory keep his cool as he serves
OL,14,     Fup a Spanish menu and a charm
OL,15,     Foffensive. (Ep4/5)
OL,16,G1340 Come Dine with Me
OL,17,     FPeterborough. Rosie has ruffled
OL,18,     Ffeathers all week. Now it's her
OL,19,     Fguests' turn to scour every
OL,20,     Felement of her Brazilian night,
OL,21,     Ffrom the samba dancers to her
OL,22,     Fauthentic pig-ear stew. (Ep5/5)
