OL,5,G1415 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe week begins at the Old Rose &
OL,7,     FCrown in Birmingham, where
OL,8,     Fpaintwork problems and missing
OL,9,     Fmilk leave hosts Andrew and Jo
OL,10,     Fwith some meaty feedback to chew
OL,11,     Fover.
OL,12,G1450 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FJill and Inez host the second
OL,14,     Fvisit at Middlewick in
OL,15,     FGlastonbury, where their guests
OL,16,     Fare confounded by a cottage next
OL,17,     Fto a camping pod, and by the
OL,18,     Favocado breakfast offering.
