OL,5,G1750 The Dog House Australia
OL,6,     FAfter moving to the coast,
OL,7,     FKristy's in search of a seadog. Is
OL,8,     Fsweet, petite puppy Hugo the right
OL,9,     Ffit for Nick? And Ron seeks a
OL,10,     Fretirement buddy for long walks.
OL,11,G1850 The Dog House
OL,12,     FLondoners Roshni and Jay go on a
OL,13,     Fdouble date with Bella the playful
OL,14,     FStaffie and Cech the shy terrier.
OL,15,     FAnd will Amy and Alex be the
OL,16,     Fperfect match for Olivia the blind
OL,17,     Fspaniel?
